{5}{Gideon is no fool.  The Hand has no conscience, it is true, but its leader is wise.  From the beginning, we distrusted the Dark Elves.  My job was to observe and decide on the best course of action.  Our other assassins were unaware of my presence...}{Gideon is no fool.  The Hand has no conscience, it is true, but its leader is wise.  From the beginning, we distrusted the Dark Elves.  My job was to observe and decide on the best course of action.  Our other assassins were unaware of my presence...}{}{}{}{}
{6}{And if I had not told Gideon of the Dark Elves involvement?}{}{5}{}{9}{}
{7}{Uh...I not understand...}{}{-4}{}{9}{}
