{9}{Had we not come here, and had you not convinced Gideon of the error of our ways, I would have killed you.  Such was my assignment, regardless of my..uh...personal opinions...}{Had we not come here, and had you not convinced Gideon of the error of our ways, I would have killed you.  Such was my assignment, regardless of my..uh...personal opinions...}{}{}{}{}
